01:00:10.730 --> 01:00:33.080
<v Ira Glass>This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange. Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, theater casting is just amazing these days. And he got the role of Maria in West Side Story, the one who sings "I feel pretty, oh, so pretty." Torey has a great voice, but after a couple of rehearsals he told the director it wasn't for him.
<v Ira Glass>《美国生活》由PRX，公共广播交易所交付给公共广播电台。像往常一样，感谢我们节目的联合创始人托里·马拉蒂亚先生。你知道，现在的戏剧选角真是太棒了。他得到了《西区故事》（West Side Story）中玛丽亚（Maria）的角色，那个唱“我感觉很漂亮，哦，如此漂亮”的人。托里有一副好嗓子，但在几次排练后，他告诉导演那不适合他。

01:00:33.080 --> 01:00:39.290
<v Jean Hannah Edelstein>I'm not someone where being good looking is my number one defining characteristic.
<v Jean Hannah Edelstein>我不是那种以长相作为头号定义特征的人。

01:00:39.290 --> 01:00:45.650
<v Ira Glass>Back next week with more stories of This American Life. I'm Ira Glass. Good day.
<v Ira Glass>下周回来，带来更多《美国生活》的故事。我是艾拉·格拉斯。祝好。

01:00:45.650 --> 01:00:50.650
<v Jean Harvey>Only now you know the rest of the story.
<v Jean Harvey>现在，你知道了故事的余韵。
